{{!
    @template local_vektradiscuss/iframe

    The Vektra-origin discussion UI (ARCH-076). The URL carries no token: the token is handed over by
    postMessage after the iframe announces itself. allow-same-origin is safe only because the UI
    origin differs from the Moodle origin (checked server-side). No top navigation, no popups.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * src - UI URL on the Vektra UI origin
    * title - accessible title

    Example context (json):
    {
        "src": "https://ui.example.test/api/v1/assess/ui?site=6f1c2a3e-8d4b-4c7e-9a10-2b3c4d5e6f70",
        "title": "Assessment discussion"
    }
}}
<iframe class="local-vektradiscuss-iframe w-100 border-0" src="{{src}}" title="{{title}}" sandbox="allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-downloads" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" allow="clipboard-write" style="height: 480px;"></iframe>
